Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: HTMLtree.c
Line: 1086
Function: htmlNodeDumpInternal
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: The code dereferences cur->last->type without checking if cur->last is NULL. For an element with no children (cur->last == NULL), reachable when formatting is enabled and the element is a known non-inline tag (e.g., <div></div>), this path is executed while emitting the closing tag, causing a NULL pointer dereference.

